{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"光伏","country":"菲律宾","country_iso":"PHL","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:25.495282","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"PHL-PV-0001","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"菲律宾Terra二期150MWp光伏项目","project_name_en":"Philippines Terra Phase II 150MWp PV Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"湖南建投安装集团有限公司","content":"践行“一带一路”倡议，发扬“湘安铁军”精神。近日，湖南安装在菲律宾市场实现滚动经营，成功中标2个重点光伏项目，进一步巩固了公司东南亚市场优势地位，为中菲能源合作贡献积极力量。\n中标\n菲律宾Terra二期1.05GWp光伏+1.2GWh储能EPC项目光伏区建筑安装工程标段一工程（G地块）\n，建设内容包括150MWp光伏区（除35kV集电线路外）所有建筑、安装及单体调试等工程。\n中标\n菲律宾拉布拉多160MW光伏总承包项目光伏区建筑安装工程\n，施工内容涵盖光伏区12区至18区（装机容量150MWp）所有业务。\n此前，公司在参建东南亚最大光储一体化电站——Terra光储一体化项目期间，凭借优良的履约表现和扎实的技术实力，赢得了业主和总包方高度认可。公司将秉承“现场即市场”理念，选派优秀管理团队，严把项目质量关与安全关，高标准实现施工目标，为未来合作奠定坚实基础。","content_sha256":"69008cdef22293e2b6ba9ff315ef8f27010fa97d7b03960c4428d844947cf212","id":182,"publish_date":"2026-02-05 11:29:03","title":"湖南安装中标2个菲律宾光伏项目","title_sha256":"8ad05ff58c1b065fb8d2169bd3353ee4783ccb40b927928604dd567bb02430ff","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/92557.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"PHL-PV-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 150MWp","capacity_mw":150.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"150","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:25.495318","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"PHL-PV-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2024/11/22/art_11019_2533636.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"湖南安装